        1       *================================================================*
        2       * PROGRAMA : FATRELAT                                            *
        3       * AULA     : 8 - COBOL IV, TABELAS INTERNAS E RELATORIOS         *
        4       * OBJETIVO : EMITIR O RELATORIO DE FATURAS: DETALHE POR          *
        5       *            TRANSACAO, TOTAL POR CARTAO (QUEBRA DE CONTROLE) E  *
        6       *            TOTAL GERAL POR CATEGORIA (MCC).                    *
        7       *            O NUMERO DO CARTAO E SEMPRE EXIBIDO MASCARADO.      *
        8       * ENTRADAS : DD APROVIN  - CPTRANI, FB 80, ORDENADO POR CARTAO   *
        9       *            DD MCCTAB   - TABELA MCC, FB 80, ORDENADA POR MCC   *
       10       * SAIDA    : DD RELATOUT - RELATORIO, FBA 133 (LINHA DE 132 +    *
       11       *            CARACTERE DE CONTROLE GERADO PELO ADVANCING)        *
       12       *================================================================*
       13        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       14        PROGRAM-ID. FATRELAT.
       15 
       16        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       17        INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       18        FILE-CONTROL.
       19            SELECT TRANS-APROVADA ASSIGN TO APROVIN
       20                   FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-APROVADA.
       21            SELECT TABELA-MCC     ASSIGN TO MCCTAB
       22                   FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-MCC.
       23            SELECT RELATORIO      ASSIGN TO RELATOUT
       24                   FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-RELATORIO.
       25 
       26        DATA DIVISION.
       27        FILE SECTION.
       28        FD  TRANS-APROVADA
       29            RECORDING MODE IS F.
       30            COPY CPTRANI.
       31        FD  TABELA-MCC
       32            RECORDING MODE IS F.
       33        01  REG-MCC.
       34            05  MC-CODIGO              PIC 9(04).
       35            05  MC-DESCRICAO           PIC X(30).
       36            05  FILLER                 PIC X(46).
       37        FD  RELATORIO
       38            RECORDING MODE IS F.
       39        01  REG-RELATORIO              PIC X(132).
       40 
       41        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       42        01  WS-FS-APROVADA             PIC X(02).
       43            88  WS-FS-APR-OK                     VALUE '00'.
       44            88  WS-FS-APR-FIM                    VALUE '10'.
       45        01  WS-FS-MCC                  PIC X(02).
       46            88  WS-FS-MCC-OK                     VALUE '00'.
       47            88  WS-FS-MCC-FIM                    VALUE '10'.
       48        01  WS-FS-RELATORIO            PIC X(02).
       49            88  WS-FS-REL-OK                     VALUE '00'.
       50 
       51       *--- TABELA DE MCC EM MEMORIA (CARREGADA DO ARQUIVO MCCTAB) -----*
       52       *    AS POSICOES NAO USADAS FICAM COM CODIGO 9999 PARA QUE A
       53       *    TABELA CONTINUE EM ORDEM CRESCENTE (EXIGENCIA DO SEARCH ALL)
       54        01  WS-MAX-MCC                 PIC 9(03) VALUE 100.
       55        01  WS-QTD-MCC                 PIC 9(03) VALUE ZERO.
       56        01  WS-TABELA-MCC.
       57            05  WS-MCC-ITEM OCCURS 100 TIMES
       58                            ASCENDING KEY IS WS-MCC-CODIGO
       59                            INDEXED BY IX-MCC.
       60                10  WS-MCC-CODIGO      PIC 9(04).
       61                10  WS-MCC-DESCRICAO   PIC X(30).
       62                10  WS-MCC-TOTAL       PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
       63                10  WS-MCC-QTD         PIC 9(07).
       64 
       65       *--- CONTROLE DA QUEBRA -----------------------------------------*
       66        01  WS-CARTAO-ANTERIOR         PIC X(16).
       67        01  WS-TOTAL-CARTAO            PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
       68        01  WS-TOTAL-GERAL             PIC S9(13)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
       69        01  WS-QTD-CARTOES             PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
       70        01  WS-DESC-CATEGORIA          PIC X(30).
       71 
       72       *--- PAGINACAO --------------------------------------------------*
       73        01  WS-LINHAS-POR-PAGINA       PIC 9(03) VALUE 50.
       74        01  WS-CONTA-LINHAS            PIC 9(03) VALUE 99.
       75        01  WS-PAGINA                  PIC 9(04) VALUE ZERO.
       76 
       77       *--- MASCARAMENTO -----------------------------------------------*
       78        01  WS-CARTAO-ABERTO           PIC X(16).
       79        01  WS-CARTAO-MASC             PIC X(16).
       80 
       81       *--- LINHAS DO RELATORIO ----------------------------------------*
       82        01  WS-CAB-1.
       83            05  FILLER                 PIC X(40) VALUE
       84                'FATURA NOTURNA - RELATORIO DE FATURAS'.
       85            05  FILLER                 PIC X(20) VALUE
       86                '(DADOS FICTICIOS)'.
       87            05  FILLER                 PIC X(60) VALUE SPACES.
       88            05  FILLER                 PIC X(07) VALUE 'PAGINA '.
       89            05  CB1-PAGINA             PIC ZZZ9.
       90            05  FILLER                 PIC X(01) VALUE SPACE.
       91        01  WS-CAB-2.
       92            05  FILLER                 PIC X(18) VALUE 'CARTAO'.
       93            05  FILLER                 PIC X(12) VALUE 'DATA'.
       94            05  FILLER                 PIC X(06) VALUE 'MCC'.
       95            05  FILLER                 PIC X(32) VALUE 'CATEGORIA'.
       96            05  FILLER                 PIC X(22) VALUE 'ESTABELECIMENTO'.
       97            05  FILLER                 PIC X(06) VALUE 'PAIS'.
       98            05  FILLER                 PIC X(16) VALUE
       99                '           VALOR'.
      100            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      101            05  FILLER                 PIC X(18) VALUE 'OBS'.
      102        01  WS-DETALHE.
      103            05  DT-CARTAO              PIC X(16).
      104            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      105            05  DT-DATA                PIC 9999/99/99.
      106            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      107            05  DT-MCC                 PIC 9(04).
      108            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      109            05  DT-CATEGORIA           PIC X(30).
      110            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      111            05  DT-ESTABELECIMENTO     PIC X(20).
      112            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      113            05  DT-PAIS                PIC X(03).
      114            05  FILLER                 PIC X(03) VALUE SPACES.
      115            05  DT-VALOR               PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
      116            05  FILLER                 PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.
      117            05  DT-OBS                 PIC X(18).
      118        01  WS-LINHA-TOTAL-CARTAO.
      119            05  FILLER                 PIC X(18) VALUE SPACES.
      120            05  FILLER                 PIC X(20) VALUE
      121                'TOTAL DO CARTAO'.
      122            05  TC-CARTAO              PIC X(16).
      123            05  FILLER                 PIC X(43) VALUE SPACES.
      124            05  TC-VALOR               PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
      125        01  WS-LINHA-MCC.
      126            05  FILLER                 PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.
      127            05  LM-MCC                 PIC 9(04).
      128            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      129            05  LM-DESCRICAO           PIC X(30).
      130            05  FILLER                 PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      131            05  LM-QTD                 PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.
      132            05  FILLER                 PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.
      133            05  LM-VALOR               PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
      134        01  WS-LINHA-GERAL.
      135            05  FILLER                 PIC X(20) VALUE
      136                'TOTAL GERAL'.
      137            05  FILLER                 PIC X(10) VALUE 'CARTOES: '.
      138            05  LG-QTD-CARTOES         PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.
      139            05  FILLER                 PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
      140            05  FILLER                 PIC X(08) VALUE 'VALOR: '.
      141            05  LG-VALOR               PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
      142 
      143        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      144        0000-PRINCIPAL.
      145            PERFORM 1000-INICIALIZAR
      146            PERFORM 2000-PROCESSAR-CARTAO UNTIL WS-FS-APR-FIM
      147            PERFORM 3000-FINALIZAR
      148            GOBACK.
      149 
      150        1000-INICIALIZAR.
      151            OPEN INPUT TABELA-MCC
      152            IF NOT WS-FS-MCC-OK
      153               DISPLAY 'FATRELAT - ERRO NO OPEN DE MCCTAB. FS='
      154                       WS-FS-MCC
      155               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      156            END-IF
      157            INITIALIZE WS-TABELA-MCC
      158            PERFORM VARYING IX-MCC FROM 1 BY 1
      159                    UNTIL IX-MCC > WS-MAX-MCC
      160               MOVE 9999 TO WS-MCC-CODIGO(IX-MCC)
      161            END-PERFORM
      162            PERFORM 1100-CARREGAR-MCC UNTIL WS-FS-MCC-FIM
      163            CLOSE TABELA-MCC
      164 
      165            OPEN INPUT  TRANS-APROVADA
      166            IF NOT WS-FS-APR-OK
      167               DISPLAY 'FATRELAT - ERRO NO OPEN DE APROVIN. FS='
      168                       WS-FS-APROVADA
      169               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      170            END-IF
      171            OPEN OUTPUT RELATORIO
      172            IF NOT WS-FS-REL-OK
      173               DISPLAY 'FATRELAT - ERRO NO OPEN DE RELATOUT. FS='
      174                       WS-FS-RELATORIO
      175               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      176            END-IF
      177            PERFORM 8000-LER-APROVADA
      178            .
      179 
      180        1100-CARREGAR-MCC.
      181            READ TABELA-MCC
      182               AT END
      183                  CONTINUE
      184               NOT AT END
      185                  IF WS-QTD-MCC >= WS-MAX-MCC
      186                     DISPLAY 'FATRELAT - TABELA MCC CHEIA'
      187                     PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      188                  END-IF
      189                  ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-MCC
      190                  MOVE MC-CODIGO    TO WS-MCC-CODIGO(WS-QTD-MCC)
      191                  MOVE MC-DESCRICAO TO WS-MCC-DESCRICAO(WS-QTD-MCC)
      192            END-READ
      193            .
      194 
      195       *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      196       * QUEBRA DE CONTROLE: UM CICLO DESTE PARAGRAFO = UM CARTAO       *
      197       *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      198        2000-PROCESSAR-CARTAO.
      199            MOVE TI-NUM-CARTAO TO WS-CARTAO-ANTERIOR
      200            MOVE ZERO          TO WS-TOTAL-CARTAO
      201            ADD 1              TO WS-QTD-CARTOES
      202            PERFORM 2100-PROCESSAR-TRANSACAO
      203               UNTIL WS-FS-APR-FIM
      204                  OR TI-NUM-CARTAO NOT = WS-CARTAO-ANTERIOR
      205            PERFORM 2200-IMPRIMIR-TOTAL-CARTAO
      206            .
      207 
      208        2100-PROCESSAR-TRANSACAO.
      209            SEARCH ALL WS-MCC-ITEM
      210               AT END
      211                  MOVE 'CATEGORIA NAO CADASTRADA' TO WS-DESC-CATEGORIA
      212               WHEN WS-MCC-CODIGO(IX-MCC) = TI-MCC
      213                  MOVE WS-MCC-DESCRICAO(IX-MCC)   TO WS-DESC-CATEGORIA
      214                  ADD TI-VALOR TO WS-MCC-TOTAL(IX-MCC)
      215                  ADD 1        TO WS-MCC-QTD(IX-MCC)
      216            END-SEARCH
      217 
      218            MOVE TI-NUM-CARTAO      TO WS-CARTAO-ABERTO
      219            PERFORM 9800-MASCARAR-CARTAO
      220            MOVE WS-CARTAO-MASC     TO DT-CARTAO
      221            MOVE TI-DATA-TRANSACAO  TO DT-DATA
      222            MOVE TI-MCC             TO DT-MCC
      223            MOVE WS-DESC-CATEGORIA  TO DT-CATEGORIA
      224            MOVE TI-ESTABELECIMENTO TO DT-ESTABELECIMENTO
      225            MOVE TI-PAIS            TO DT-PAIS
      226            MOVE TI-VALOR           TO DT-VALOR
      227            IF TI-SUSPEITA
      228               MOVE 'SUSPEITA'      TO DT-OBS
      229            ELSE
      230               MOVE SPACES          TO DT-OBS
      231            END-IF
      232            PERFORM 7000-IMPRIMIR-DETALHE
      233 
      234            ADD TI-VALOR TO WS-TOTAL-CARTAO WS-TOTAL-GERAL
      235            PERFORM 8000-LER-APROVADA
      236            .
      237 
      238        2200-IMPRIMIR-TOTAL-CARTAO.
      239            MOVE WS-CARTAO-ANTERIOR TO WS-CARTAO-ABERTO
      240            PERFORM 9800-MASCARAR-CARTAO
      241            MOVE WS-CARTAO-MASC     TO TC-CARTAO
      242            MOVE WS-TOTAL-CARTAO    TO TC-VALOR
      243            WRITE REG-RELATORIO FROM WS-LINHA-TOTAL-CARTAO
      244                  AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
      245            MOVE SPACES TO REG-RELATORIO
      246            WRITE REG-RELATORIO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
      247            ADD 2 TO WS-CONTA-LINHAS
      248            .
      249 
      250        3000-FINALIZAR.
      251            PERFORM 7100-IMPRIMIR-CABECALHO
      252            MOVE 'TOTAL POR CATEGORIA (MCC)' TO REG-RELATORIO
      253            WRITE REG-RELATORIO AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES
      254            PERFORM VARYING IX-MCC FROM 1 BY 1
      255                    UNTIL IX-MCC > WS-QTD-MCC
      256               MOVE WS-MCC-CODIGO(IX-MCC)    TO LM-MCC
      257               MOVE WS-MCC-DESCRICAO(IX-MCC) TO LM-DESCRICAO
      258               MOVE WS-MCC-QTD(IX-MCC)       TO LM-QTD
      259               MOVE WS-MCC-TOTAL(IX-MCC)     TO LM-VALOR
      260               WRITE REG-RELATORIO FROM WS-LINHA-MCC
      261                     AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
      262            END-PERFORM
      263            MOVE WS-QTD-CARTOES TO LG-QTD-CARTOES
      264            MOVE WS-TOTAL-GERAL TO LG-VALOR
      265            WRITE REG-RELATORIO FROM WS-LINHA-GERAL
      266                  AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES
      267            CLOSE TRANS-APROVADA RELATORIO
      268            DISPLAY 'FATRELAT - CARTOES NO RELATORIO: ' WS-QTD-CARTOES
      269            .
      270 
      271        7000-IMPRIMIR-DETALHE.
      272            IF WS-CONTA-LINHAS >= WS-LINHAS-POR-PAGINA
      273               PERFORM 7100-IMPRIMIR-CABECALHO
      274            END-IF
      275            WRITE REG-RELATORIO FROM WS-DETALHE
      276                  AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
      277            ADD 1 TO WS-CONTA-LINHAS
      278            .
      279 
      280        7100-IMPRIMIR-CABECALHO.
      281            ADD 1 TO WS-PAGINA
      282            MOVE WS-PAGINA TO CB1-PAGINA
      283            WRITE REG-RELATORIO FROM WS-CAB-1 AFTER ADVANCING PAGE
      284            WRITE REG-RELATORIO FROM WS-CAB-2 AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES
      285            MOVE ALL '-' TO REG-RELATORIO
      286            WRITE REG-RELATORIO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
      287            MOVE 4 TO WS-CONTA-LINHAS
      288            .
      289 
      290        8000-LER-APROVADA.
      291            READ TRANS-APROVADA
      292               AT END CONTINUE
      293            END-READ
      294            IF NOT WS-FS-APR-OK AND NOT WS-FS-APR-FIM
      295               DISPLAY 'FATRELAT - ERRO NO READ DE APROVIN. FS='
      296                       WS-FS-APROVADA
      297               PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
      298            END-IF
      299            .
      300 
      301            COPY CPMASCAR.
      302 
      303        9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO.
      304            MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
      305            STOP RUN
      306            .
